  "unable": {
    "evidence_refs": [
      "compiled_client baseline: `const number = $.derived(() => await Promise.resolve(5));` — await inside non-async arrow emitted by ConstTag transform",
      "packages/svelte/src/compiler/phases/3-transform/client/visitors/ConstTag.js:1-85 (create_derived with plain thunk, no async handling)",
      "packages/svelte/src/compiler/phases/3-transform/client/visitors/AwaitExpression.js:1-120 (is_reactive_expression returns true for metadata parents but ConstTag transform path still emits non-async derived thunk)",
      "packages/svelte/src/compiler/phases/2-analyze/visitors/AwaitExpression.js:1-31 and 2-analyze/visitors/ConstTag.js:1-40 (no await-flagging for const-tag scopes)",
      "baseline_status=intended_failure: 'await isn't allowed in non-async function' in dom and hydrate modes"
    ],
    "reason": "No public-green candidate was produced. Diagnosis: the client ConstTag transform (packages/svelte/src/compiler/phases/3-transform/client/visitors/ConstTag.js) unconditionally wraps {@const x = await ...} initializers with create_derived(b.thunk(init)), emitting `$.derived(() => await Promise.resolve(5))` — an await inside a non-async arrow, which rollup rejects with \"await isn't allowed in non-async function\" (the exact baseline failure in both dom and hydrate modes). The AwaitExpression transform's async handling (b.call(b.await(b.call('$.save', ...)))) fires because is_reactive_expression finds metadata on the path, but the enclosing thunk/derived is never made async, so the emitted code is syntactically invalid. Two hypotheses were recorded (H1: ConstTag must use an async-derived mechanism when the initializer contains await, e.g. an async thunk + $.async-derived; H2: analysis must flag const-tag scopes so the transform selects the async path). I did not have sufficient remaining call budget to inspect create_derived/async-derived utilities in client/utils.js, implement and stage a patch, and validate it against the reproducer. Staging requires the upstream fix pattern (Svelte PR for \"await doesn't work with @const\") which I could not verify against this codebase before exhausting the budget. Therefore no candidate was staged and the issue remains unresolved."
  },
